  "contract": [
    "Svr.plz calls its edit-document OTd, then refreshes undo/redo labels and availability through rFJ.",
    "cZl.OTd checks the document enable gate, selects the current manager journal, checks availability, sets EbT true, calls daR.wi2, then clears EbT on normal return.",
    "cZn insertion and removal hooks skip ordinary journal recording when cZl.EbT is true. No new recording edit or begin/end wrapper is needed for this document Undo path.",
    "daR.wi2 retains the replay head in kG, replays it, clears kG, and moves MkF to the previous head on normal return.",
    "Neither document OTd nor journal wi2 has an exception handler. An exception can retain replay state. Ghostnote must latch, never reset flags, never retry, and require recovery.",
    "The doctor proves its context manager equals document nrP and finds the existing journal before calling OTd; this prevents the document journal lookup from creating a different journal.",
    "Undo and Redo have the same local normalized method shape. The two-edge call trace distinguishes their journal bodies. No obfuscated name is used as a selector."
  ]
}
